      501.45
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act No. 48 of 2007, I, Mahinda Rajapaksa, Minister of Finance and Economic Affairs of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this order impose in respect of the list of commodities speci\ufb01 ed in Column I of the Schedule hereto a Special Commodity Levy at the rates speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entries in Column II of that Schedule.",
